# Schema Provenance for sigmond-clickhouse

The WSPR schema files under `schema/wsprdaemon/` are vendored verbatim
from the upstream `wsprdaemon-server` so that local rows are
byte-for-byte equivalent to the rows wsprdaemon.org expects.  Keeping
this DDL in sync with upstream is the wire-compat anchor for the
future hs-uploader's WSPR shipping path.

## Vendored from

- Repo:    https://github.com/rrobinett/wsprdaemon-server
